{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James, been a few days. The convo got me thinking about my passions and goals. Thanks for encouraging me to try new game genres."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-15735ebb5cdb8e17b804ec79", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:16.459990+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "15735ebb5cdb8e17b804ec79", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "15735ebb5cdb8e17b804ec79", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! Nice to hear from you! Glad our chat made an impact. What sort of games are you interested in exploring?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-e15803ffa54f172c80c0e2f9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:20.572926+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e15803ffa54f172c80c0e2f9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e15803ffa54f172c80c0e2f9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Lately, I've been playing some different genres like strategy and RPG games instead of my usual shooters. I\u2019m already thinking about making competitions for them too."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-3bc26ae1d44d0f928fca5b7c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:24.681535+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3bc26ae1d44d0f928fca5b7c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3bc26ae1d44d0f928fca5b7c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: That's great, John! Trying out different genres can really add to your gaming experiences. Have you come across any standout games?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-16fbf22a3c26ebe7b32be7ce", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:28.809099+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "16fbf22a3c26ebe7b32be7ce", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "16fbf22a3c26ebe7b32be7ce", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hooked a new RPG that I've been playing lately! The storytelling and characters are amazing, can't get enough of it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-f19255a7051739bd34623b4e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:32.965685+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f19255a7051739bd34623b4e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f19255a7051739bd34623b4e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Sounds great! I think storytelling is what makes RPGs so fun. What game are you playing? Do you have any favorite characters?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-039f7da18786123874ec8c75", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:37.089220+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "039f7da18786123874ec8c75", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "039f7da18786123874ec8c75", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'm playing \"The Witcher 3\"! There's this awesome monster hunter with a cool story, and I'm totally hooked, trying to make the right choices to shape the world. It's really immersive."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-874cc219931efd2209633220", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:41.209204+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "874cc219931efd2209633220", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "874cc219931efd2209633220", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yeah, \"The Witcher 3\" is amazing! I love how you can shape the world with your choices and feel the impact. The graphics are insane too - check out this pic."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-0f3c8e42ffc68edb4dc8cdb5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:45.324764+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0f3c8e42ffc68edb4dc8cdb5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0f3c8e42ffc68edb4dc8cdb5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That's a great pic! The graphics are truly stunning! By the way, look how I organized my workplace!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-3ee70a94e67d2c89d3f970c0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:49.463704+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3ee70a94e67d2c89d3f970c0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3ee70a94e67d2c89d3f970c0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Cool! Wall lighting adds beauty to your workspace."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-87c500d0e45c8f9c9bb96a01", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:53.602735+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "87c500d0e45c8f9c9bb96a01", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "87c500d0e45c8f9c9bb96a01", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks James! What's new with you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-5550458eed89ea894429947f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:21:57.725971+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5550458eed89ea894429947f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5550458eed89ea894429947f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yesterday I took my three dogs to a beach outing to have fun and bond with other dogkeepers."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-89cc841e71557bc1aa50be98", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:22:01.870423+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "89cc841e71557bc1aa50be98", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "89cc841e71557bc1aa50be98", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cool! Surely you gained a new experience from communicating with other dog lovers!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-a9f6982f5d850d146408b222", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:22:05.976507+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a9f6982f5d850d146408b222", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a9f6982f5d850d146408b222", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yes, we had fun and I even met one beautiful girl. I'm thinking of asking her out on a date! She left me her phone number, I think I'll call tomorrow."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-f50ec064b8ca4b72983db663", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:22:10.104084+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f50ec064b8ca4b72983db663", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f50ec064b8ca4b72983db663", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow! That's cool, what's her name? Be sure to call her, everything will work out!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-3f6e2511c020b8c193b81fce", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:22:14.245189+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3f6e2511c020b8c193b81fce", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3f6e2511c020b8c193b81fce", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: She is Samantha. I'll definitely call her!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-237bff4dc2915d7a79d48fd1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:22:18.416066+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "237bff4dc2915d7a79d48fd1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "237bff4dc2915d7a79d48fd1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yoohoo! Hope you have a wonderful time!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_19-5e0108c4899d4c2227e4a4d4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:22:22.539945+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e0108c4899d4c2227e4a4d4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e0108c4899d4c2227e4a4d4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
